        "text": "Measured in the run\n- users rps 116 = 20 journeys/s scheduled x 5.8 requests per journey (run.json resolved_schedule, http_reqs / iterations)\n- app end-to-end p50 535.528 = sample-weighted p50 of 6 operation(s) at 116 rps; seen from the client, so it includes queueing, the network and any database call\n- app overlap 12 = most requests of one operation in flight at once (metrics.overlap); a lower bound on the app's real concurrency, set by the run's own VUs and arrival pattern\n- app capacity 12 = the overlap above, which is more than Breakscale's default\n- app errorRate 0 = the run's unexpected HTTP failure rate",
